WEBVTT

02:35.140 --> 02:36.040
Did you…

02:36.540 --> 02:38.120
read my diary?

02:42.020 --> 02:44.020
I just accidentally glanced at it.

02:48.020 --> 02:49.240
What did you see at that glance?

02:51.340 --> 02:52.860
That you said…

02:55.540 --> 02:57.240
I didn't write to you,

02:58.920 --> 03:00.480
nor call you.

03:04.020 --> 03:05.460
You don't want to get hurt

03:07.080 --> 03:08.540
because of me anymore.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.320
But now

03:15.440 --> 03:17.880
I don't want you
to get hurt because of yourself.

03:36.880 --> 03:37.860
Yingtao.

03:38.780 --> 03:39.920
Did I…

03:40.420 --> 03:41.840
scare you today?

03:43.140 --> 03:44.740
Jiang Qiaoxi, you're…

03:50.660 --> 03:51.500
bad.

03:54.700 --> 03:56.180
I always make you cry, right?

03:56.220 --> 03:57.360
Yes.

04:00.340 --> 04:01.980
But even so…

04:04.280 --> 04:05.460
I still want to tell you…

04:08.160 --> 04:09.060
that knowing you

04:10.940 --> 04:12.980
is the luckiest thing for me.

04:13.780 --> 04:14.920
Jiang Qiaoxi.

04:15.520 --> 04:17.480
When I look into your eyes,

04:19.660 --> 04:21.060
all I see is you.

04:22.680 --> 04:24.740
Every time I call your name,

04:24.780 --> 04:26.760
I can only remember
the sunset clouds in Qunshan.

04:28.020 --> 04:29.540
They belong to you.

04:30.480 --> 04:31.660
I did introduce them to you.

04:32.440 --> 04:34.460
And you can't return them.

04:35.300 --> 04:36.820
Even if you tried,

04:38.880 --> 04:40.080
I wouldn’t take it.

04:44.260 --> 04:45.520
Don’t worry, Yingtao.

04:47.000 --> 04:48.180
I get it now.

04:51.200 --> 04:52.300
I finally know…

04:55.020 --> 04:56.940
what I’m living for.

05:04.680 --> 05:05.620
Alright.

05:05.660 --> 05:06.740
That's all.

05:08.760 --> 05:10.500
- Okay.
- I'll get some more leek flower.

05:10.540 --> 05:11.460
Okay.

05:13.140 --> 05:14.100
Coming.

05:14.820 --> 05:15.800
- Mr. Jiang.
- Please.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.660
Qiaoxi's inside.

05:18.700 --> 05:19.660
Thanks.

05:20.500 --> 05:21.360
Have a seat.

05:22.300 --> 05:23.140
‪Well…

05:24.880 --> 05:27.920
- Take a seat, please.
- Have a seat!

05:28.420 --> 05:29.560
- Join us for dinner.
- Thank you.

06:21.980 --> 06:22.900
Your hands.

06:26.820 --> 06:27.840
Hello.

06:47.780 --> 06:49.820
Did Yingtao and Jiang Qiaoxi cry?

06:57.000 --> 06:58.480
Look at Qin Yeyun's expression.

06:59.400 --> 07:00.400
She's totally

07:01.100 --> 07:02.160
mocking us.

07:08.540 --> 07:11.080
Let her laugh if she wants.

07:13.780 --> 07:16.000
You can too, if you feel like it.

07:24.260 --> 07:26.160
From this moment on,

07:27.760 --> 07:28.960
consider…

07:29.700 --> 07:31.240
the old Jiang Qiaoxi…

07:32.100 --> 07:33.140
gone.

07:35.640 --> 07:36.920
The one exists now…

07:38.980 --> 07:40.440
is the one belongs to Qunshan,

07:42.680 --> 07:44.480
but more importantly, to yourself.

07:46.300 --> 07:48.460
No one gets to control you anymore.

07:49.220 --> 07:51.080
No one gets to cage you.

07:52.860 --> 07:54.900
You’ll live as Jiang Qiaoxi…

07:54.940 --> 07:55.920
truly and fully.

08:00.780 --> 08:01.980
But listen,

08:02.020 --> 08:03.260
No matter what happens,

08:03.300 --> 08:04.800
don't hurt yourself.

08:04.840 --> 08:06.240
Never again.

08:10.100 --> 08:11.100
Never again.

08:14.720 --> 08:15.940
Because…

08:18.660 --> 08:20.480
Yingtao saw me.

08:21.700 --> 08:23.140
And so did Qunshan.

08:25.680 --> 08:26.880
Today…

08:28.000 --> 08:29.100
I’m finally…

08:30.260 --> 08:31.200
free.

09:04.260 --> 09:06.680
Starting today, I’m done with all of this.

09:06.720 --> 09:08.660
I have a name, it’s Jiang Qiaoxi.

09:09.880 --> 09:11.400
But all he wanted was to get

09:11.440 --> 09:12.300
far, far away from you.

09:12.340 --> 09:14.960
He disappeared on a tiny hill
right near home.

09:15.000 --> 09:16.980
- Do you really believe that was just…
- Don't talk about him like that!

09:17.020 --> 09:18.340
Then how should I talk about him?

09:24.080 --> 09:25.460
Go ask him at his memorial tablet.

09:25.500 --> 09:27.200
Ask if I, Jiang Qiaoxi,
ever did him wrong.

09:27.240 --> 09:28.820
Then fine. I'll return it all.

09:28.860 --> 09:29.940
I'm only going to be me!

09:29.980 --> 09:32.040
Why? Why!

09:38.560 --> 09:40.040
Is it serious?

09:41.940 --> 09:43.420
Alright, I'm on my way now.

09:47.440 --> 09:48.400
What happened?

09:48.440 --> 09:50.500
Haifeng. It's Qiaoxi's mom,

09:50.540 --> 09:52.480
Hongfei. She's been in a car accident.

09:52.520 --> 09:53.580
I need to go now.

09:53.620 --> 09:54.520
Okay.

09:55.440 --> 09:56.720
I'll go with you.

09:56.760 --> 09:57.820
Hurry up!

10:06.200 --> 10:07.420
Yingtao, come here.

10:16.540 --> 10:17.420
Mom.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.780
- What's wrong?
- Yingtao.

10:23.060 --> 10:24.420
Qiaoxi's mom was in a car accident.

10:24.460 --> 10:25.420
Right now, Mom and Dad

10:25.460 --> 10:26.860
are going to the hospital
with Uncle Jiang.

10:26.900 --> 10:28.180
You stay home with Qiaoxi.

10:29.160 --> 10:30.540
Then I…

10:30.580 --> 10:31.520
Don’t panic.

10:31.560 --> 10:32.400
You have us at the hospital.

10:32.440 --> 10:33.840
You look after Qiaoxi.

10:52.560 --> 10:53.480
Hongfei.

11:09.120 --> 11:10.500
The patient is very fortunate.

11:10.540 --> 11:12.180
The injuries aren’t severe.

11:12.220 --> 11:14.620
Most are soft tissue contusions,

11:15.360 --> 11:17.800
with minor concussion.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.940
She may experience vomiting

11:19.980 --> 11:21.180
or dizziness recently.

11:21.680 --> 11:22.980
For now,

11:23.020 --> 11:24.120
rest is critical,

11:24.160 --> 11:25.580
and she must avoid emotional distress.

11:33.500 --> 11:34.600
I understand that

11:34.640 --> 11:36.180
mathematical talent

11:36.220 --> 11:37.940
often comes with a strong personality.

11:37.980 --> 11:41.220
But what you're showing now
isn't personality.

11:41.260 --> 11:43.140
It's sheer stubbornness!

11:43.840 --> 11:45.480
That guaranteed admission
through the Olympiad

11:45.520 --> 11:47.040
that you just threw away.

11:47.540 --> 11:49.520
The chance to showcase your skills

11:49.560 --> 11:51.720
on a international stage

11:51.760 --> 11:53.100
that you flat-out rejected.

11:53.600 --> 11:54.820
Do you even realize

11:55.320 --> 11:57.560
what you've given up?

11:57.600 --> 11:59.500
These weren't just
your personal opportunities,

11:59.540 --> 12:00.980
they were moments for
Experimental High School,

12:01.020 --> 12:03.900
even our entire Jialin City to shine!

12:04.460 --> 12:06.100
Principal, please calm down.

12:06.140 --> 12:08.080
Jiang Qiaoxi must have his reasons.

12:08.120 --> 12:09.540
Let’s talk this through with him properly.

12:09.580 --> 12:11.180
I’ve respected his ideas too much.

12:11.220 --> 12:12.500
That’s why he’s become this…

12:12.540 --> 12:13.800
this arrogant!

12:13.840 --> 12:15.360
Jiang Qiaoxi.

12:15.400 --> 12:18.160
You’d better seize the opportunities
in your hands.

12:18.660 --> 12:20.300
The director was right.

12:20.340 --> 12:22.400
You must take it seriously.

12:22.900 --> 12:23.880
Jiang Qiaoxi,

12:24.600 --> 12:25.920
to me,

12:25.960 --> 12:28.380
you’ve always been
a sensible, exemplary student.

12:28.420 --> 12:29.800
We all know

12:29.840 --> 12:31.960
this is just teenager rebellion
that clouds your judgment,

12:32.000 --> 12:33.920
and we understand.

12:33.960 --> 12:36.640
But you need to think.
Really understand the situation.

12:36.680 --> 12:38.180
It's not hard to understand here.

12:38.220 --> 12:40.000
With a mind like his,

12:40.040 --> 12:41.500
how could he possibly

12:41.540 --> 12:43.440
not come to his senses?

12:43.480 --> 12:46.260
Forget about your parents’
years of sacrifice,

12:46.780 --> 12:50.340
or the school’s investment in you.

12:50.380 --> 12:51.840
Just think from your own.

12:52.780 --> 12:53.920
You're not even an adult yet.

12:53.960 --> 12:55.780
Do you know what decisions

12:55.820 --> 12:57.060
actually benefit you?

12:57.560 --> 12:59.180
Do you know what to do

12:59.220 --> 13:01.000
to take real responsibility for yourself?

13:02.000 --> 13:03.840
Principle, sorry.

13:03.880 --> 13:05.760
- Here.
- Take a seat, please.

13:06.260 --> 13:06.940
Our child

13:06.980 --> 13:09.080
- Lin Qile, what are you doing here?
- has caused everyone so much trouble.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.980
You didn’t skip class, did you?

13:11.020 --> 13:13.220
No, it’s lunch break now.

13:13.260 --> 13:15.200
I’m bringing Auntie Liang her meal.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.980
Uncle Jiang, this is…

13:18.520 --> 13:20.020
pigeon soup my mom stewed.

13:20.960 --> 13:22.120
She packed it right in.

13:22.160 --> 13:23.340
It might be hot.

13:23.380 --> 13:25.040
Tomorrow, would fish soup be okay?

13:26.260 --> 13:27.980
Thank you and your parents.
Much appreciated.

13:28.020 --> 13:30.180
No worries. We’re neighbors.

13:30.220 --> 13:31.440
Helping each other is what we do.

13:33.620 --> 13:34.680
Jiang Qiaoxi.

13:35.200 --> 13:37.340
My parents asked you
to come home for dinner.

13:37.840 --> 13:38.840
You've been tired lately.

13:39.420 --> 13:42.140
If we don’t remind you,
you won’t eat a thing.

13:42.180 --> 13:43.560
We have to watch you for your meals.

13:44.060 --> 13:44.900
Go home and eat.

13:46.060 --> 13:49.720
Alright. Ms, Sir and Principal.
I'll take my leave now.

13:51.920 --> 13:53.100
- Goodbye, Uncle Jiang.
- Okay.

13:53.140 --> 13:54.000
Goodbye, Auntie Liang.

13:54.900 --> 13:56.000
Goodbye to you all.

14:00.120 --> 14:01.380
Look.

14:02.340 --> 14:03.480
How well-behaved…

14:05.540 --> 14:06.440
your son is!

14:12.400 --> 14:14.140
Were those teachers…

14:15.440 --> 14:17.240
really angry just now?

14:20.600 --> 14:21.580
Yes.

14:21.620 --> 14:24.280
They all want the old Jiang Qiaoxi back,

14:26.000 --> 14:27.920
not who I am now.

14:31.400 --> 14:33.380
What do I do, Yingtao?

14:37.700 --> 14:38.820
What others think of you…

14:39.800 --> 14:40.780
It doesn’t matter.

14:42.520 --> 14:44.820
What matters what Jiang Qiaoxi thinks.

14:49.300 --> 14:50.300
What about you?

14:51.080 --> 14:52.780
Which Jiang Qiaoxi…

14:52.820 --> 14:53.840
do you like?

15:05.200 --> 15:06.040
I believe…

15:06.580 --> 15:08.600
the one that make you feel truly happy,

15:09.780 --> 15:11.820
the one who loves himself the most,

15:13.680 --> 15:14.820
is the best Jiang Qiaoxi.

15:21.460 --> 15:23.140
Yingtao, you are truly amazing.

15:26.940 --> 15:29.040
Have you been particularly tired
these two days?

15:30.900 --> 15:31.880
I’m fine.

15:32.540 --> 15:34.260
Nothing compares to the old me.

15:35.100 --> 15:36.440
It’s just…

15:37.020 --> 15:40.520
listening to that clichés every day.

15:40.560 --> 15:41.680
It’s dull.

15:44.380 --> 15:46.720
And… now?

15:51.180 --> 15:54.380
Now… maybe a little better.

15:55.000 --> 15:56.500
Just a little?

15:57.040 --> 15:59.260
With a view this stunning

15:59.960 --> 16:01.260
and sunlight this warm,

16:01.300 --> 16:02.540
just a little better?

16:10.600 --> 16:11.740
True.

16:13.240 --> 16:15.560
Nothing feels warmer than this moment.

16:19.780 --> 16:22.180
If you keep doing that,
you're going to fall.

16:22.880 --> 16:23.820
I won’t.

16:26.340 --> 16:27.680
I have you with me now.

16:28.580 --> 16:29.900
I won't fall.

16:34.960 --> 16:36.940
Do you trust me so much?

16:52.980 --> 16:56.040
Yingtao. Why have you never asked me…

16:58.520 --> 16:59.840
what I want to do in the future?

17:07.859 --> 17:09.339
These questions…

17:11.740 --> 17:13.359
are exhausting,

17:13.400 --> 17:15.040
and you’ve been tired for so long.

17:17.359 --> 17:19.260
Take some rest now.

17:26.480 --> 17:29.240
It is useless to ask me whether
Jiang Qiaoxi will come to the school.

17:29.280 --> 17:31.880
He himself doesn't know probably.
Only Lin Qile knows.

17:32.380 --> 17:33.500
Not only does she know,

17:33.540 --> 17:35.180
her parents probably know too.

17:35.220 --> 17:36.120
Nonsense.

17:36.160 --> 17:37.280
If himself doesn’t know,

17:37.320 --> 17:38.160
how could Lin Qile possibly know?

17:38.700 --> 17:40.880
Cai Fangyuan isn’t lying. It’s true.

17:40.920 --> 17:44.240
Back when Jiang Qiaoxi
studied with us in Qunshan,

17:44.280 --> 17:46.080
he’d vanish right after school.

17:46.120 --> 17:48.680
The only place to find him
is at the Lin's.

17:48.720 --> 17:51.260
He was this close for a permanent seat

17:51.300 --> 17:52.360
at Lin's house.

17:52.400 --> 17:53.280
He was basically

17:53.320 --> 17:56.760
the son of Lin's.

17:56.800 --> 17:57.640
They were that close?

17:57.680 --> 17:58.880
- Lin Qile.
- Of course.

17:59.420 --> 18:01.120
When exactly will
Jiang Qiaoxi return to school?

18:01.160 --> 18:02.660
What now?

18:02.700 --> 18:04.280
You’re always mad at me!

18:04.320 --> 18:05.420
I don’t even need you to say it.

18:05.460 --> 18:06.440
I don't know either.

18:06.480 --> 18:08.540
He's a bit unreliable.
But you don't believe me?

18:08.580 --> 18:11.240
I didn't say that I don't believe you.

18:11.280 --> 18:12.840
We'll see…

18:13.500 --> 18:15.400
when he wants to come back.

18:37.300 --> 18:38.140
Lin Qile.

18:38.640 --> 18:40.140
So when exactly does Jiang Qiaoxi plan

18:40.180 --> 18:41.080
to return to school?

18:43.600 --> 18:45.960
We'll see when he comes back.

18:48.960 --> 18:50.000
Lin Qile.

18:53.820 --> 18:56.000
You're answering questions with questions.

18:56.600 --> 18:58.160
Stop dodging me with the nonsense.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.460
I genuinely don’t know.

19:01.600 --> 19:03.460
You’re the one grilling me with questions.

20:16.440 --> 20:17.520
No wonder it's so heavy.

20:18.420 --> 20:19.800
Who told you to get on?

20:19.840 --> 20:20.780
Get off, now!

20:21.280 --> 20:22.420
Watch out.

20:23.020 --> 20:24.840
Kids these days. Do they
have some senses of time?

20:24.880 --> 20:26.600
The one thing I am not missing now

20:27.540 --> 20:28.620
is time.

20:30.520 --> 20:32.340
You’ve got all the time in the world now?

20:32.880 --> 20:34.060
Wandering around like a drifter.

20:34.100 --> 20:35.100
No schooling.

20:35.140 --> 20:36.340
Or at least get a factory job?

20:42.300 --> 20:44.180
What does Jiang Qiaoxi even want?

20:44.220 --> 20:45.840
He ditched the national training,

20:45.880 --> 20:47.040
skipped the national team.

20:47.080 --> 20:48.240
threw away guaranteed admission.

20:48.280 --> 20:49.620
Now he won’t even show up to school?

20:49.660 --> 20:50.660
What’s in his mind?

20:51.680 --> 20:53.140
This is his own decision.

20:53.180 --> 20:54.980
When he wants to talk about it, he will.

20:55.020 --> 20:56.460
All I can do is to…

20:56.500 --> 20:58.860
support him as a friend.

20:58.900 --> 21:00.820
If I’m truly worried,

21:00.860 --> 21:02.340
my only concerns are

21:02.380 --> 21:04.620
whether he eats properly and sleeps well.

21:04.660 --> 21:06.240
Whether he is living it happily.

21:06.280 --> 21:08.960
If your questions upset him,

21:09.000 --> 21:10.300
I won’t ask him for them.

21:11.020 --> 21:13.860
Lin Qile, do you realize
how dangerous his current state is?

21:14.920 --> 21:16.560
He just wants to be himself.

21:16.600 --> 21:18.060
I don’t see any danger in that.

21:28.980 --> 21:30.060
- Yingtao.
- I am good.

21:32.420 --> 21:34.200
Qiaoxi, have some spare ribs.

21:34.240 --> 21:35.540
Thank you, Auntie.

21:35.580 --> 21:37.640
Take bowls and spoons. Let me do it.

21:37.680 --> 21:38.540
Let me help you.

21:39.980 --> 21:40.820
The spoons.

21:40.860 --> 21:43.080
Take the soup bowls over too.

21:47.600 --> 21:49.060
Guess what soup it is?

21:51.760 --> 21:52.940
Egg drop soup.

21:57.200 --> 21:59.020
- You were right.
- I just had it.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.500
Thank you, Uncle.

22:42.720 --> 22:44.740
Qiaoxi, let me do it.

22:44.780 --> 22:46.660
No, I can do it alone.

22:46.700 --> 22:48.020
- I can help you.
- No, it's fine.

22:48.720 --> 22:49.640
Alright.

22:58.120 --> 22:59.560
You do it.

23:05.600 --> 23:06.760
- Uncle.
- Yes?

23:06.800 --> 23:09.540
If there’s anything you want to ask me,

23:09.580 --> 23:10.580
just go ahead.

23:12.460 --> 23:13.500
No, I mean…

23:14.260 --> 23:15.740
Earlier…

23:15.780 --> 23:17.540
Yingtao told us

23:17.580 --> 23:18.800
not to ask you anything.

23:18.840 --> 23:20.840
We figured…

23:20.880 --> 23:22.820
if you want to talk, you will.

23:22.860 --> 23:24.760
If not, that’s fine too.

23:25.340 --> 23:27.300
But today…

23:28.600 --> 23:29.700
well…

23:29.740 --> 23:31.600
now it feels I am crossing the line.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.380
It’s alright, Uncle.

23:34.880 --> 23:36.300
If you want to say it,

23:36.340 --> 23:37.860
please do. I’m ready to listen.

23:38.940 --> 23:40.260
- Ready?
- Yes.

23:41.920 --> 23:44.900
So… how do you see it for

23:44.940 --> 23:47.820
your skills, no, let’s call it talent?

23:47.860 --> 23:49.100
Any plans for it?

23:51.960 --> 23:54.020
Do you have any suggestions?

23:54.660 --> 23:55.600
I think…

23:56.100 --> 23:57.480
Secretary Li made…

23:57.520 --> 23:59.080
some fair points earlier.

23:59.120 --> 24:01.480
It’d be a real shame to…

24:01.520 --> 24:03.140
- Dad! Dad.
- let that talent go to waste.

24:03.180 --> 24:04.220
Stop talking.

24:04.260 --> 24:06.760
I’ve heard all that so many times,
my ears are calloused.

24:06.800 --> 24:07.660
So did Jiang Qiaoxi.

24:07.700 --> 24:08.820
You handle the trash bags.
I’ll do the washing.

24:08.860 --> 24:09.760
It’s fine. I am in this already.

24:09.800 --> 24:11.160
Alright, let’s drop it then.

24:12.040 --> 24:13.160
But…

24:13.660 --> 24:15.700
since so many people have said it, today…

24:15.740 --> 24:16.620
I really need to say it.

24:16.660 --> 24:17.760
- Because…
- Don't say it!

24:17.800 --> 24:18.960
What Dad said today,

24:19.000 --> 24:20.520
it’s different from what others have said.

24:25.480 --> 24:26.620
I believe…

24:28.380 --> 24:30.000
you came into this world…

24:30.040 --> 24:32.560
with your talent,

24:32.600 --> 24:35.100
not the other way around.

24:35.140 --> 24:37.820
We shouldn’t be shackled,

24:37.860 --> 24:39.340
drained, or consumed by it.

24:39.380 --> 24:40.460
Instead,

24:40.500 --> 24:42.200
we should wield it well.

24:42.240 --> 24:43.780
Let it make you shine.

24:43.820 --> 24:45.920
If you're happy,

24:46.540 --> 24:47.940
then that's no waste of it.

24:48.860 --> 24:49.780
Otherwise…

24:50.400 --> 24:51.440
what’s wasted…

24:52.160 --> 24:53.440
isn’t your talents.

24:54.460 --> 24:55.700
It’s your life.

25:04.980 --> 25:07.100
I've made it clear. Did you understand?

25:08.180 --> 25:09.100
I understand,

25:09.140 --> 25:12.320
but what the secretary sir said earlier
didn’t quite sound like that.

25:13.360 --> 25:15.220
With him here,
I can’t exactly say this out loud.

25:15.260 --> 25:16.640
There’s nobody else around now,

25:16.680 --> 25:18.080
can’t we even say it quietly?

25:21.360 --> 25:22.920
That’s exactly the point.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.240
Just for your reference.

25:28.580 --> 25:30.980
Yingtao, I truly envy you.

25:35.380 --> 25:36.440
Before…

25:37.000 --> 25:38.600
everyone just told me

25:38.640 --> 25:40.260
not to waste my talent,

25:41.440 --> 25:43.380
but no one ever cared about

25:43.420 --> 25:44.760
what those gifts…

25:45.340 --> 25:46.900
could actually mean for me.

25:48.520 --> 25:49.840
Only you, Uncle Lin,

25:50.540 --> 25:51.960
see through the talents

25:52.580 --> 25:53.840
and you see me.

25:56.200 --> 25:57.920
So only I saw it?

25:57.960 --> 25:59.460
I saw it, too.

25:59.500 --> 26:00.340
Me too.

26:00.380 --> 26:02.640
We all saw it. Everyone saw it.

26:04.460 --> 26:05.460
Thank you, everyone.

26:05.960 --> 26:07.120
I really…

26:07.620 --> 26:08.920
needed to hear these words.

26:10.740 --> 26:12.760
They mean… so much to me.

26:13.940 --> 26:16.200
Yingtao, see that?

26:16.240 --> 26:18.580
From now on, listen to your dad more.

26:18.620 --> 26:19.820
His advice

26:19.860 --> 26:22.500
comes genius-approved!

26:23.500 --> 26:25.340
I’ll listen to Dad more.

26:25.380 --> 26:26.960
Why don’t you say something to me too?

26:27.000 --> 26:27.840
I’m all ears right now.

26:27.880 --> 26:28.860
With you?

26:30.840 --> 26:33.740
Okay, what I'm about to say
is very important. Listen carefully!

26:33.780 --> 26:34.980
You…

26:35.580 --> 26:37.220
cannot skip carrots in meals!

26:38.220 --> 26:39.660
No, I just won't eat them!

26:54.700 --> 26:55.540
Dad.

26:59.760 --> 27:02.440
Feeling pretty pleased
with yourself right now, aren't you?

27:06.040 --> 27:08.000
I'd always pictured this moment

27:08.040 --> 27:09.880
to cope with being alone.

27:10.780 --> 27:11.940
I was sure

27:11.980 --> 27:13.340
it would feel amazing

27:13.380 --> 27:14.620
if I ever actually did it.

27:15.220 --> 27:16.940
But now that it's happening…

27:18.800 --> 27:20.220
I just feel calm.

27:24.640 --> 27:25.480
You feel calm,

27:26.220 --> 27:27.500
but what about our family?

27:28.340 --> 27:29.640
All these years of effort

27:30.420 --> 27:32.620
tossed out like trash.

27:43.260 --> 27:44.220
Qiaoxi.

27:45.440 --> 27:47.540
I never imagined

27:48.420 --> 27:49.940
you could be this heartless.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.780
Really…

27:53.280 --> 27:54.580
no room left at all?

28:02.400 --> 28:03.360
Dad.

28:04.800 --> 28:06.540
Do you want to keep it as a memento?

28:18.520 --> 28:19.380
Have you eaten yet, Dad?

28:19.420 --> 28:20.540
Let me cook for you.

28:22.860 --> 28:23.700
How is your hand?

28:26.020 --> 28:27.100
Fully recovered.

28:28.640 --> 28:30.680
Your mom still can't move on,
you know that?

28:32.220 --> 28:33.140
An Olympiad gold medalist

28:33.840 --> 28:34.960
gets into the national team,

28:36.120 --> 28:37.460
guaranteed admission to Qingbei.

28:39.040 --> 28:41.220
All of that was what she wanted for you.

28:41.260 --> 28:43.420
And now you're throwing it all away?

28:54.120 --> 28:54.960
Dad.

28:55.000 --> 28:56.660
I'll go get rid of these garbages now.

29:04.420 --> 29:06.320
Mom, try this.

29:17.500 --> 29:18.420
Quite delicious.

29:19.780 --> 29:20.860
I made it myself.

29:22.080 --> 29:23.080
Am I…

29:23.120 --> 29:24.280
quite talented at cooking?

29:28.440 --> 29:29.460
Wait a moment.

29:32.260 --> 29:33.440
Another dish.

29:39.540 --> 29:40.580
I'll pour you a cup of tea.

29:48.720 --> 29:51.400
You’re wasting all your talent and brains

29:51.440 --> 29:52.800
on this nonsense.

29:52.840 --> 29:54.000
You wanna be a cook?

29:54.560 --> 29:55.520
No.

29:56.300 --> 29:58.300
When I'm cooking,

29:58.340 --> 29:59.940
I don't think about anything else.

30:00.720 --> 30:02.100
You're determined to destroy yourself.

30:03.480 --> 30:04.360
You could've chosen

30:04.400 --> 30:06.980
any of a thousand,
no, ten thousand ways to hurt me.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.180
Why did it have to be math?

30:19.240 --> 30:20.620
Do you even remember…

30:20.660 --> 30:22.300
how I started math at the first place?

30:25.080 --> 30:26.200
Of course I remember.

30:27.220 --> 30:29.300
You were just four years old
in kindergarten,

30:29.340 --> 30:31.540
while all the other children
played with toys,

30:31.580 --> 30:32.640
you sat there…

30:33.400 --> 30:34.560
focused on the abacus.

30:35.320 --> 30:36.540
That’s when

30:36.580 --> 30:38.600
we first saw your gift for math.

30:38.640 --> 30:40.540
So we sent you to Olympiad training.

30:40.580 --> 30:42.860
In less than a year, you brought home
awards, one after another.

30:43.600 --> 30:44.900
Everyone said…

30:45.940 --> 30:47.360
I’d given birth to another genius.

30:53.580 --> 30:54.940
What I remember is…

30:55.900 --> 30:57.120
at the kindergarten,

30:57.840 --> 30:59.240
on a Mother's Day,

30:59.880 --> 31:01.300
I gave you a drawing of you

31:02.260 --> 31:04.080
with your smile in it.

31:07.220 --> 31:09.060
But when you got it, you said…

31:10.500 --> 31:12.900
what you really wanted was
a children's math Olympiad medal.

31:14.500 --> 31:15.700
Later when I won one,

31:17.000 --> 31:18.180
you were so happy,

31:18.680 --> 31:20.180
smiling just like in that drawing.

31:22.340 --> 31:23.840
You even took me to the park,

31:24.900 --> 31:26.420
where we lay…

31:26.460 --> 31:27.640
on a boat together

31:28.280 --> 31:30.100
watching clouds drift by.

31:31.360 --> 31:32.760
That was the first time

31:33.680 --> 31:36.020
I felt happier than
a seagull soaring in the sky.

31:38.700 --> 31:39.700
I remember.

31:41.260 --> 31:42.380
I remember all of it.

31:48.940 --> 31:50.180
But then,

31:51.500 --> 31:52.900
I found a photo…

31:55.800 --> 31:57.380
of you and Jiang Mengchu.

32:00.740 --> 32:02.060
The same park,

32:02.560 --> 32:03.720
the same boat,

32:05.540 --> 32:07.260
even the same smile.

32:07.860 --> 32:09.700
I truly wanted to believe

32:09.740 --> 32:10.980
you were happy because of me.

32:12.920 --> 32:14.760
You kept searching in my eyes…

32:16.000 --> 32:17.580
for traces of Jiang Mengchu.

32:21.120 --> 32:22.680
But all I ever wanted was a mother,

32:23.420 --> 32:24.320
not mathematics.

32:28.860 --> 32:30.580
So what you want is for me

32:31.880 --> 32:33.300
to admit I failed you, is that it?

32:37.620 --> 32:39.320
Don’t you also want me to admit

32:39.360 --> 32:41.940
I’ve wasted the talents you gave me?

33:00.280 --> 33:01.160
Mom.

33:01.660 --> 33:03.760
You are trapped in being
the mother of a genius.

33:04.540 --> 33:05.700
You are using me…

33:06.640 --> 33:08.560
to prove Jiang Mengchu ever existed.

33:09.940 --> 33:11.180
So do I.

33:13.120 --> 33:15.520
I am trapped as being the prodigy,

33:16.120 --> 33:17.460
going against you

33:17.960 --> 33:19.940
just to prove I’m not him.

33:21.140 --> 33:22.040
But Mom…

33:22.080 --> 33:24.140
our endless resentment

33:25.280 --> 33:26.980
is meaningless.

33:34.700 --> 33:36.080
What are you really trying to tell me?

33:48.280 --> 33:49.960
If we can't…

33:50.000 --> 33:52.060
stop resenting each other,

33:53.880 --> 33:54.800
then let's leave it.

33:56.740 --> 33:59.220
Maybe we should focus on
finding ourselves first,

34:01.040 --> 34:02.040
our whole selves.

34:02.580 --> 34:03.660
Then maybe…

34:04.720 --> 34:06.800
when we look into each other's eyes again,

34:09.380 --> 34:10.659
there will be no more resentments.

34:12.540 --> 34:14.320
Do you really think you’re so impressive,

34:14.360 --> 34:16.199
cooking for me,

34:16.239 --> 34:17.960
lecturing me?

34:18.000 --> 34:19.300
Let me make this clear.

34:20.000 --> 34:21.820
Everything I do

34:23.040 --> 34:24.780
is for your future.

34:25.320 --> 34:27.900
You’re about to face this brutal world.

34:28.400 --> 34:31.120
I feel pathetic for
your clueless ignorance

34:32.080 --> 34:33.120
of this world.

34:50.560 --> 34:51.639
For the future?

34:52.139 --> 34:53.679
Of this world?

34:53.719 --> 34:55.380
I am indeed clueless and ignorant.

34:56.260 --> 34:58.000
But the one thing I do know is,

34:58.040 --> 34:59.780
they're in my hands now.

35:02.080 --> 35:03.380
Only I get to have it.

35:34.840 --> 35:37.520
I never expected things
to go this smoothly.

35:38.020 --> 35:38.940
My website

35:38.980 --> 35:40.860
isn't just gaining more readers.

35:40.900 --> 35:42.420
It's attracting more writers too.

35:43.340 --> 35:44.860
And guess what?

35:44.900 --> 35:48.520
A while back, someone actually
offered me a whole eighty thousand

35:48.560 --> 35:49.740
to buy it!

35:49.780 --> 35:51.240
Wait, hold up. Eighty thousand?

35:51.780 --> 35:53.860
Cai Fangyuan, you’re going to be
a millionaire of 80K!

35:53.900 --> 35:55.400
Sell it now!

35:55.440 --> 35:56.780
Sell? Never.

35:57.480 --> 35:59.220
I’m building a sanctuary

35:59.260 --> 36:00.720
for Chinese literature.

36:01.220 --> 36:02.900
No money could buy that.

36:02.940 --> 36:04.280
It’s my spirit and passion.

36:05.420 --> 36:06.420
Merchant of Principle!

36:17.020 --> 36:18.780
What's that?

36:18.820 --> 36:21.560
Brain fuel. Get smarter,

36:22.220 --> 36:23.980
remember more. Here.

36:24.800 --> 36:26.200
What’s wrong with your brain?

36:26.720 --> 36:27.740
Exceptional memory

36:27.780 --> 36:29.640
and quick reflexes are fundamental

36:29.680 --> 36:30.960
for becoming a pilot.

36:31.620 --> 36:32.680
Next month,

36:32.720 --> 36:34.340
the Air Force recruitment
begins for Year 12.

36:34.880 --> 36:35.980
My turn comes next year.

36:36.580 --> 36:38.240
Physically,

36:38.280 --> 36:39.880
I'm fully qualified physically.

36:39.920 --> 36:41.380
but I need to prep for it mentally.

36:41.420 --> 36:42.380
To be on the safe side.

36:45.540 --> 36:47.440
Qin Yeyun, you should eat more too.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.500
Aren’t you in business?

36:48.540 --> 36:50.080
A top-tier shady merchant

36:50.120 --> 36:51.880
needs a sharp mind.

36:52.480 --> 36:54.280
Don’t you agree, Doctor Du?

36:55.180 --> 36:58.360
Look at us, our Qunshan Squard’s

36:58.400 --> 37:00.060
got all bases covered. Brains, brawn,

37:00.100 --> 37:01.240
every profession under the sun.

37:04.120 --> 37:05.560
- Lin Yingtao.
- Don't ask me.

37:05.600 --> 37:08.900
I'm still thinking hard
about life's major choices.

37:09.660 --> 37:10.900
Who asked you?

37:11.400 --> 37:12.720
I was talking about Jiang Qiaoxi.

37:13.220 --> 37:15.340
- What’s actually going on in his head?
- Right.

37:15.840 --> 37:17.760
We're not trying to pressure him.

37:17.800 --> 37:19.900
We just want to understand
what he's thinking.

37:19.940 --> 37:22.300
Everyone else is
making plans for their future,

37:22.340 --> 37:23.960
but he gave up his guaranteed admission

37:24.460 --> 37:25.960
and never shared his plans.

37:26.980 --> 37:28.360
I don't know either.

37:29.380 --> 37:31.360
He didn’t even tell you?

37:31.400 --> 37:33.560
Then Jiang Qiaoxi's just inconsiderate.

37:35.280 --> 37:36.860
I really don’t know.

37:37.860 --> 37:39.400
Sometimes I feel like

37:40.120 --> 37:41.260
he doesn’t think about…

37:41.880 --> 37:43.400
the future at all.

37:43.900 --> 37:45.320
And other times, it’s like

37:45.360 --> 37:46.880
he plans out everything all along.

37:49.300 --> 37:50.520
Yingtao,

37:50.560 --> 37:52.340
then why don't you ask him?

37:52.380 --> 37:53.800
How can I even ask him?

37:54.300 --> 37:55.680
No matter how I phrase it,

37:55.720 --> 37:57.080
it’ll just feel like pressure.

37:57.580 --> 37:59.420
Jiang Qiaoxi…

37:59.920 --> 38:01.240
has always been so strong-willed.

38:02.040 --> 38:03.060
He must've thought about it.

38:03.820 --> 38:04.860
I think so too.

38:04.900 --> 38:06.640
I bet he’s already made up his mind.

38:07.140 --> 38:09.280
If he's not telling you,
he's planning either a surprise,

38:09.860 --> 38:10.880
or a shock.

38:13.940 --> 38:14.980
Probably not.

38:15.640 --> 38:18.360
I think he'll tell us when he's ready.

38:28.020 --> 38:29.800
Have you actually

38:29.840 --> 38:31.180
talked to that Lin girl

38:31.220 --> 38:32.240
or not?

38:32.280 --> 38:34.040
What exactly do you want?

38:34.700 --> 38:35.820
Not yet.

38:36.320 --> 38:37.940
How should I even say it, bro?

38:37.980 --> 38:39.820
I realize…

38:39.860 --> 38:41.660
I get kinda timid around her.

38:41.700 --> 38:42.880
What are you afraid of?

38:42.920 --> 38:44.600
If I tell her

38:44.640 --> 38:46.180
and she asks me to stay,

38:46.760 --> 38:48.460
I won't know what to do.

38:48.960 --> 38:51.140
But if she just says, "Go ahead",

38:51.180 --> 38:52.680
I think I'd be even more lost.

38:52.720 --> 38:54.660
Then it's simple,

38:54.700 --> 38:57.180
just tell her

38:57.220 --> 38:58.720
to come with you. Problem solved.

38:58.760 --> 39:01.760
Won't work. She's a total homebody.

39:01.800 --> 39:03.080
No way she'd follow me.

39:03.120 --> 39:04.160
Looks like you’ll

39:04.200 --> 39:05.960
have to figure out what you truly want

39:06.700 --> 39:07.540
okay?

39:08.220 --> 39:10.040
Even I, as your big brother,
can’t solve this one.

39:10.080 --> 39:11.000
It’s your call to make.

39:25.760 --> 39:26.880
Hey math king,

39:26.920 --> 39:28.440
you’re back to school now, right?

39:29.220 --> 39:31.320
You haven’t given up on math, have you?

39:31.960 --> 39:33.140
I don't like maths.

39:33.940 --> 39:35.260
How could that be?

39:35.300 --> 39:36.240
My dad said

39:36.280 --> 39:38.740
your math intuition is one in a million.

39:38.780 --> 39:40.980
You solve problems
like a skillful butcher.

39:41.020 --> 39:43.120
With all this talent and years of effort,

39:43.160 --> 39:44.300
you'd just walk away?

39:46.780 --> 39:48.220
I am heading to the classroom now.

39:49.300 --> 39:50.940
Senior Jiang.

39:50.980 --> 39:53.460
Does your dislike for math now
have something to do with Senior Qile?

39:54.080 --> 39:55.500
I’ve heard

39:55.540 --> 39:58.000
ever since she transferred to
Experimental High School, you changed.

39:58.040 --> 39:58.880
What I mean is…

39:58.920 --> 40:01.520
Every decision I've made
has been my own choice.

40:01.560 --> 40:02.920
Lin Qile has nothing to do with it.

40:05.520 --> 40:06.740
Senior.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.120
I’ll take my leave now.

40:11.280 --> 40:12.680
You’re back at school?

40:12.720 --> 40:13.960
You didn’t even tell me first.

40:14.520 --> 40:16.000
Felt like coming back, so here I am.

40:17.700 --> 40:21.060
Let’s grab late-night snacks
after evening self-study.

40:22.620 --> 40:23.600
You two?

40:24.100 --> 40:25.420
- What about us?
- Yeah.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.340
Go eat by yourselves!

40:28.960 --> 40:30.520
You two are everywhere. Scram!

40:33.240 --> 40:34.940
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Qiaoxi's back.

40:34.980 --> 40:36.980
- Jiang Qiaoxi.
- Finally back.

40:37.020 --> 40:38.180
Jiang Qiaoxi's back.

40:38.900 --> 40:40.020
Jiang Qiaoxi?

40:40.580 --> 40:42.880
You're finally back, Jiang Qiaoxi.

40:42.920 --> 40:44.880
You're finally back.

40:44.920 --> 40:46.860
- Long time no see.
- Long time no see.

40:46.900 --> 40:48.360
While you were away, I got all the math

40:48.400 --> 40:49.240
notes for you.

40:49.280 --> 40:50.220
- That's you?
- Yes.

40:50.260 --> 40:52.120
- Thank you.
- I thought you weren't coming back.

40:52.160 --> 40:53.380
Read them now? I can go get them.

40:53.420 --> 40:54.460
- Okay.
- Go get him.

40:54.500 --> 40:56.220
- Aren't you going now?
- I'll fetch it.

40:57.500 --> 40:58.700
Where did I put it?

41:04.960 --> 41:07.200
Turn to page 58.

41:25.840 --> 41:26.680
Is this appropriate?

41:26.720 --> 41:28.480
Studying English during math class?

41:28.520 --> 41:29.980
Really, Jiang Qiaoxi?

41:30.020 --> 41:31.580
Genius Jiang!

41:36.400 --> 41:37.940
Is this proper behavior, Principal?

41:37.980 --> 41:39.660
Look at your prized student here,

41:39.700 --> 41:42.160
throwing tantrums for over two weeks.

41:42.200 --> 41:43.740
And now in the middle of class,

41:43.780 --> 41:46.020
suddenly he's pulling
this teenage rebellion?

41:46.060 --> 41:47.360
Read English during math class,

41:47.400 --> 41:48.960
reading math during English.

41:49.700 --> 41:52.260
Reading math during English, are you sure?

41:59.780 --> 42:00.760
Lin Yingtao.

42:00.800 --> 42:03.120
Which country is Jiang Qiaoxi
going to study abroad in?

42:05.080 --> 42:05.920
What?

42:07.220 --> 42:08.060
You don't know?

42:11.220 --> 42:12.220
I…

42:13.000 --> 42:14.900
Who said he's going to study abroad?

42:14.940 --> 42:15.820
Who?

42:16.380 --> 42:18.480
Earlier when I went to the office
to collect assignments,

42:18.520 --> 42:21.700
Ms. Qu mentioned that
Jiang Qiaoxi was reading TOEFL materials

42:21.740 --> 42:23.480
during math class today.

42:24.020 --> 42:25.300
He didn't tell you?

42:39.380 --> 42:40.800
He doesn’t need to tell anyone.

42:42.120 --> 42:43.340
His future…

42:44.400 --> 42:45.600
is his own to plan.

42:57.760 --> 42:58.880
Why did she leave?

45:21.920 --> 45:24.760
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
